                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I let a friend of mine play a wide variety of games, to experience them. Good games, bad games, horrible games... It's not often he aborts a game, yet this is one of those. Mostly because the mouse isn't bound to the window, and we lost the gamewindow a couple of times. Sometimes you just don't want to handle that, and move on to the next game. \n\nThis doesn't look like an awful game. Reading the reviews some people have experienced this on an older console. Barely anyone has played this beyond an hour. So with my very limited exposure to the game I join those ranks. \n\n[table]\n[tr]\n[td]\n[i]More reviews at [url=https://store.steampowered.com/curator/39546715/]Omnivore Gamer[/url], games that are easy to control (for handicapped gamers). [/i][/td]\n[/tr]\n[/table]",
